{
  "_about": "D77 (2026-10-27). What counts as a LIVE graded or proctored test, so JARVIS (which solves PRACTICE material for the owner) does not complete one. Read by jarvis/plugins/_shared/exam_guard.py. CONSOLE-ONLY: an agent cannot edit this file (kernel policy.SAFETY_COMPONENTS, push_gate.PROTECTED). The owner's own command to solve the problems in a folder or file he names is his statement that they are practice, so ordinary files and ordinary practice pages never match; only strong live-test signals do. Tiers: 'decline' = proctoring, webcam, screen-share, lock-down browser, a contest page, a proctoring vendor (nothing the owner says overrides it; JARVIS offers to teach the concept with different examples); 'ask' = an assessment host, honor-code or pledge text, an 'online assessment' banner (one short question; only 'it is practice' continues); 'weak' = a weight, and the total of the weak signals must reach ask_threshold. Practice words (practice, mock, sample, lab, homework ...) take weight off the weak signals only. Each 'why' is the fixed sentence the owner reads; a page never supplies it.",
  "ask_threshold": 3,
  "hosts": [
